{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202602dRjbxJpQ1792658956.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞殘運，輪椅劍擊港隊女子重劍團體奪銀牌。</p><p></p><p>右方、由余翠怡、湯雅婷、林嘉雯及范珮珊組成的港隊，直入四強，以30-14輕取烏茲別克。</p><p></p><p>決賽面對國家隊，第二局，右方B級代表湯雅婷一度追近4-5，但之後被拉開，完三局落後6-15。A級重劍個人賽銅牌得主、左方的余翠怡，「守尾門」對冠軍辜海燕，未能取分。港隊輸10-30，繼花劍團體決賽，再次不敵國家隊，奪得銀牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:30.208135+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:18:03.416844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:03.137758+00:00","content_hash":"ddaf577505489fbab61cb895cc4503234dad89842f7f494bd9962075ed1fc916","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:30.208135+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}